=== leading-doublestar-slash
--- .gitignore
**/foo
--- paths
foo
foo/
a/foo
a/b/foo
a/b/foo/
foo/bar
a/foo/bar
afoo
a/foobar

=== leading-doublestar-slash-with-name-below
--- .gitignore
**/foo/bar
--- paths
foo/bar
a/foo/bar
a/b/foo/bar
foo/x/bar
a/foo/bar/baz
bar

=== trailing-slash-doublestar
--- .gitignore
abc/**
--- paths
abc
abc/
abc/x
abc/x/
abc/x/y
x/abc/y
abc/.hidden

=== middle-doublestar
