a/**/b
--- paths
a/b
a/x/b
a/x/y/b
a/x/y/b/
a/b/c
ab
x/a/b
a/xb
a/x/yb

=== doublestar-alone
--- .gitignore
**
--- paths
a
a/
a/b
.hidden

